error: `size` takes a `read string` here, which cannot go to another task: a `read string` is a borrow, and the task could outlive what it borrows from
  --> error_task_borrow_argument.sg:7:28
 7 |     var t = Task.run(size, read name)
   |                            ^^^^^^^^^
  hint: give the task a value of its own: a `string` to own, or a `shared string` that both keep
